#NEXUS

[ cau2015a_fig6: Theropod-to-bird strict consensus, read in six bands at native resolution and at 1.3-2x where verticals crowd (the Zuolong-Coelurus nodes, the maniraptoran backbone). Polytomies: Tanycolagreus, Coelurus, Tyrannosauroidea and the rest; the three therizinosaurines; Oviraptor, Khaan and Citipati; Jinfengopteryx, Aurornis, Troodontidae, Dromaeosauridae and Avialae (five); Sinovenator, Mei and the rest; Zanabazar, Troodon and Saurornithoides; the three unenlagiines; Tianyuraptor and two dromaeosaurid clades; the four basal ornithuromorphs with the rest; Ichthyornis, Gansus, Apsaravis and (Vegavis, Meleagris). AVIALAE is kept on its node; Bremer values are not encoded. 121 tips, 10 polytomies (4, 3, 3, 5, 3, 3, 3, 3, 5, 4 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 8 case (census 2, seed 20261251). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

